	"""
	The weather watches, warnings and advisories of the National Weather Service in force now, such as a winter
	storm warning, a red flag warning for fire danger or a flood advisory, filtered by state, zone, point, event,
	urgency, severity or certainty. Pass area CO for every active weather alert in Colorado, or point
	39.7392,-104.9903 for the alerts that cover downtown Denver. These are weather alerts: the National Park Service
	publishes the alerts about closures inside national parks.
	"""
